ur pricing discipline across the rest of the markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/24/valmont-industries-inc-vmi-q2-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"VMI 2019 Q2","e":"vmi","d":"2019-07-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark C. Jaksich","x":"The improvement resulted from strong market conditions and disciplined pricing in the lighting and telecom markets in North America, along with cost savings associated with the capacity reductions we took in the Asia Pacific region last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/24/valmont-industries-inc-vmi-q2-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"VMI 2019 Q2","e":"vmi","d":"2019-07-24","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Nathan Jones","x":"I mean you guys had $0.20 of non-recurring charges here and you cut the guidance by $0.20.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/24/valmont-industries-inc-vmi-q2-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"VMI 2019 Q3","e":"vmi","d":"2019-10-24","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Nathan Jones","x":"Is that -- if you imported from China, the tariffs on it would make them so expensive that's just not feasible?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/24/valmont-industries-inc-vmi-q3-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"VMI 2019 Q3","e":"vmi","d":"2019-10-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Stephen G. Kaniewski","x":"Well, the mills try to get some price increases out there, more than likely, that will be a response to some sliding prices, but we don't see anything that would be substantial up or much more down.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/24/valmont-industries-inc-vmi-q3-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"VMI 2019 Q3","e":"vmi","d":"2019-10-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Nathan Jones","x":"I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/24/valmont-industries-inc-vmi-q3-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"VMI 2019 Q3"