m that point forward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/20/valmont-industries-inc-vmi-q4-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"VMI 2020 Q1","e":"vmi","d":"2020-04-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Nathan Jones","x":"I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/23/valmont-industries-inc-vmi-q1-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"VMI 2020 Q1","e":"vmi","d":"2020-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Stephen G. Kaniewski","x":"Over the past five years, we have deliberately diversified our supply chain and taken significant cost out of our business, through the transformation and restructuring of our operations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/23/valmont-industries-inc-vmi-q1-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"VMI 2020 Q1","e":"vmi","d":"2020-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Stephen G. Kaniewski","x":"Since we do not expect meaningful changes to the market demand environment in Australia, we initiated a focused restructuring plan in this business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/23/valmont-industries-inc-vmi-q1-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"VMI 2020 Q1","e":"vmi","d":"2020-04-23","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mark C. Jaksich","x":"As a result, we are withdrawing our full year guidance for 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/23/valmont-industries-inc-vmi-q1-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"VMI 2020 Q2","e":"vmi","d":"2020-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Avner M. Applbaum","x":"This quarter, we executed on planned restructuring actions across the companies and the details are noted on slide 38 in the presentation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/valmont-industries-inc-vmi-q2-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"VMI 2020 Q2","e":"vmi","d":"2020-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Avner M. Applbaum","x":"Net sales are estimated to be between $680 million and $700 million, with operating income margins between 8% to 9% of net sales excluding any restructuring activities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/valmont-industries-inc-vmi-q2-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"VMI 2020 Q3","e":"vmi","d":"2020-10-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Nathan Jones","x":"Thanks very much, I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/valmont-industries-inc-vmi-q3-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"VMI 2020 Q3","e":"vmi","d":"2020-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Avner M. Applbaum","x":"First, we are using advanced technology and automation to streamline processes, redeploying capital and people to more strategic and innovative opportunities in the company.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/valmont-industries-inc-vmi-q3-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"VMI 2020 Q3","e":"vmi","d":"2020-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Avner M. Applbaum","x":"Net sales are estimated to be between $715 million and $735 million, with operating income margins between 8% to 9% of net sales, excluding any restructuring activity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/valmont-industries-inc-vmi-q3-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"VMI 2020 Q4","e":"vmi","d":"2021-02-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Stephen G. Kaniewski","x":"We quickly responded to inflationary pressures, which occurred late in the year by implementing price increases in all four segments and have implemented additional increases in early 2021.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/18/valmont-industries-inc-vmi-q4-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"VMI 2020 Q4","e":"vmi","d":"2021-02-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Avner M. Applbaum","x":"…you do kind of look at your modeling, right, you're taking into consideration right that our growth, we have the 2% FX and then we do have the price component, but if you want to model, I'd say between 2% to 4% of the growth is coming from pricing and a lot of that will actually be pass through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/18/valmont-industries-inc-vmi-q4-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"VMI 2020 Q4","e":"vmi","d":"2021-02-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Avner M. Applbaum","x":"Earnings per share is estimated to be between $9 and $9.70, excluding any restructuring activities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/18/valmont-industries-inc-vmi-q4-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"VMI 2021 Q1","e":"vmi","d":"2021-04-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Nathan Jones","x":"I'll pass it on and let some other people dig in.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/22/valmont-industries-inc-vmi-q1-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"VMI 2021 Q1","e":"vmi","d":"2021-04-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Avner M. Applbaum","x":"Earnings per share is estimated to be between $9 and $9.70, excluding any restructuring activities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/22/valmont-industries-inc-vmi-q1-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"VMI 2021 Q1","e":"vmi","d":"2021-04-22","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Avner M. Applbaum","x":"We are also reaffirming our outlook for the full year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/22/valmont-industries-inc-vmi-q1-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"VMI 2021 Q2","e":"vmi","d":"2021-07-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Stephen G. Kaniewski","x":"For example, in North America, Irrigation, this year we've raised price five times on irrigation systems, totaling more than 30% inclusive of upcoming increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/22/valmont-industries-inc-vmi-q2-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"VMI 2021 Q2","e":"vmi","d":"2021-07-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Stephen G. Kaniewski","x":"